   "actionTime": "13:18:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House rose from the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union to report H.R. 3898.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2025-12-11",
   "actionTime": "13:13:51",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 936, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Peters amendment No. 8.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
